    "https://ru.edu/about-randall/jobs/": {
      "title": "Job Openings",
      "description": "Job Openings | Job Openings – Randall University Visit Apply Get Info Give × Online Degrees Get Info Alumni Store Apply Visit My Saint Give About About About Randall History A Word From Our President What We Believe Mission Statement Faculty/Staff Directory Student Right To Know Our Accreditation Evaluation and Assessment California Online EADA Report 2025 Security & Fire Safety Report Job Openings Our Location Contact Us COVID-19 COVID-19 CARES ACT CRRSAA ARP-21 Prospective Students Admissions Apply Campus Tours Future U Day Degree Programs Undergraduate Degrees Graduate Degrees Online Degree Programs Financial Aid Scholarships Request Information Academics Associate Degree Undergraduate Degrees Biology Business Administration Christian Ministry Exercise Science History Intercultural Studies Ministry and Business Multidisciplinary Psychology Teacher Education Worship and Music Online Degree Programs Graduate Programs Master of Arts in Ministry Master of Arts in Teaching Master in Educational Leadership Academic Resources Populi Email Library Course Schedule College Catalog Academic Records Student Life Current Students Events Student Services Student Center Chapel Cafe Menu Academic Resources Populi Email Library Student Forms Alumni Alumni Home Alumni Update Academic Records Athletics Store Online Degrees Get Info Alumni Store Job Openings Interested in working at Randall University? We will list below any current staff, faculty, or administrative job openings at the university. If none are listed at this time, please come back and visit us soon, as new opportunities may have opened up! Current Openings: Assistant Professor of Computer Science/Adjunct Instructor of Computer Science Full-Time Faculty, Business Department If you would like to turn a resume in for us to have on file, you can email your resume to careers@ru.edu About Randall Randall University is a Christian institution of higher education committed to the intellectual, spiritual, social, moral, and physical development of its students. We seek to prepare students to serve the Lord Jesus Christ, both in the church and in society at large. More about who we are. Randall University has been the fulfillment of a vision for Free Will Baptist Christian higher education in Oklahoma since 1917. Since then, the institution has grown to three undergraduate schools (Arts and Sciences, Christian Ministry, and Education) and the Randall Graduate School. More about Randall's history. Randall University is located in Moore, Oklahoma which is just south of Oklahoma City. We are also just north of Norman, Oklahoma, home to numerous educational, social, and cultural opportunities. Our location is ideal because we have all the benefits of being located close to larger cities, while being nestled in Moore a town of about 60,000 people, with all of the small town benefits that offers. More about our location. Randall University is accredited by Transnational Association of Christian Colleges and Schools ( TRACS ), the Oklahoma Office of Education Quality and Assurance (OEQA) , and the State Accrediting Agency of the Veterans Administration . More about our accreditations and affiliations here . About News & Events Mission Statement What We Believe Biblical Foundations Statement Philosophy of Education The History of Randall University Benjamin Randall Our Location Who We Are Who We Are Faculty / Staff Directory Randall University Calendar Student Right To Know Preparation for Professional Licensure Randall Privacy Policy Randall Refund Policy Randall Title IV Code of Conduct Nondiscrimination Statement & Grievance Policy 2021 Crime Data Previous Security & Fire Safety Reports FERPA Gramm Leach Bliley Act Accreditation and Associations Evaluation and Assessment Assessment Plan CAAP Scores Objectives and Measures for Assessment Job Openings Contact Us 2025 Security & Fire Safety Report Get More Info + Stay Connected! Please enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form. Full Name * Email * Submit 3701 S. I-35 Service Rd Moore, OK 73160 (405) 912-9000 info@ru.edu Give Get Info About Admissions Resources Academics Student Life Athletics Alumni Store Online Classes Visit Apply Careers Contact Student Achievement Events News Cafe Menu Contact Student Complaints and Appeals Student Achievement © 2026 Randall University, All rights reserved This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply."
